(m)
"port" or "application port" means a set of software rules which identifies and permits communication between
application to application, network to network, computer to computer, computer system to computer system;
(n)
"Review Committee" means the Review Committee constituted under rule 419-A of the Indian Telegraph Rules, 1951;
(o)
"security policy" means documented business rules and processes for protecting information and the computer
resource;
